# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large regenerable artifacts.
#
# Nothing here is a result. Every path below is either a third-party download
# (model weights, reference databases) or an intermediate that the scripts in
# this repository rebuild from those downloads. The repo keeps the code, the
# small result tables and the figures; it does not keep ~30 GB of inputs.
# See README.md ("Reproducing the analysis") for how to fetch each one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Reference sequence database (419 MB; exceeds GitHub's 100 MB file limit)
DS569k.parquet

# Kraken2 databases (~22 GB) - download from the Kraken2 index page
kraken/kraken_db/

# ESM-2 650M weights (~2.4 GB) - fetched from HuggingFace on first run
esm_embedding/model_650m/
esm_embedding/pretrained/

# Precomputed Swiss-Prot embeddings (~2.8 GB) - supplied with the exercise
esm_embedding/downloaded_embeddings/
esm_embedding/esm_embeddings/

# DIAMOND databases built from Swiss-Prot and VFDB (~449 MB)
esm_embedding/diamond/

# Embedding intermediates rebuilt by embed_missing.py / uniprot_650m_map.py
esm_embedding/results/missing_650m.npy
esm_embedding/results/missing_650m_partial.f32
esm_embedding/results/missing_650m_partial.npz
esm_embedding/results/missing_650m_partial_acc.txt
esm_embedding/results/missing_650m_accessions.txt
esm_embedding/results/missing_to_embed.parquet
esm_embedding/results/prelim_sim.npy
esm_embedding/results/umap*_coords.parquet
esm_embedding/results/umap_annotations.parquet
esm_embedding/results/*.log

# AlphaFold server outputs: the .zip files are the originals and are kept;
# extracted/ is just those unpacked
alphafold_orfs/extracted/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environments, caches, OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# Unrelated personal document that was sitting in this folder - excluded so it
# is never published. Move it out of the project when convenient.
alphafold_orfs/*.docx
